@format 1
@id files.clear
@title Clear file list
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Remove every item, publish an empty selection, and notify tab lifecycle handlers of every removed path.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related files.add, files.remove

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] Clear requested <input>
- Receive a clear request from the list, relay policy, or worklist action @ list.PListClear(...)
> clear

[clear] Clear list state <process>
- Remove all items, selected paths, and the current path @ list.PListClear(...)
- Rebuild rows, update the empty notice, and publish path change @ list.PListClear(...)
- Publish the removed paths so a loaded viewer and its flow can be invalidated @ list.PListClear(...)
> result

[result] List cleared <output>
= No media item remains; if the loaded path was removed, the tab attachment force-closes Preview and clears its flow.
